  "_comment": "Vegeta's own specials, by hand; npm run rom -- states --fighter vegeta merges them into states.json (src/rom/specials.ts). big_bang is move ad, the Big Bang shot upward (owner, 2026-10-31): on the ground, 10 health, its parts mad / mad_2 / mad_3. The flash at the hands (vegeta_flash, mad_2's first frame) is not put out yet. final_flash is move ac (docs/rom.md, Final Flash): 10 health, A held charges \u2014 let go before frame 20 the small beam, before 32 the medium, else the large (field f0, $20:9A82); the ball grows 2 a frame from 16 at 24, -46. mac_2 fires head, base and band (size 16 / 12 / 8, never thicker); then move b5 holds the pose until the head is gone and 24 / 20 / 16 frames more (jumps to 72 / 76 / 80 of 96). As for Goku's Kamehameha, the charge fires as it decides (the original shows 2 more frames, a jump to frame 42) and the head outlives its thrower's move.",
